{"3775850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pawn City", "steam_appid": 3775850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small storefront and work your way to becoming the city’s ultimate entrepreneur. Buy, sell, and trade anything that comes through your door as you build your empire one deal at a time. Manage and upgrade your shop, hire employees to keep business growing. Grow your influence, discover new opportunities, and develop your modest<br> business into a huge monopoly that takes over the entire city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Have A Small Team That Has Put This Project Together And We Will Continue To Build And Update The Community As We Go! Here's A Brief Rundown Of Our Roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/e332aaef3611ae4f76f6db9db835047a.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 /></span>BannanaDev Is Our Development Lead, Elliot Cecere And SnorMike (aka Michael Cali) Are In Charge Of Music Production, Slicersteel0 Is Our Head Modeler, And I'm Crow I Handle The Creative Development And Marketing For Our Game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In Pawn City You Can Gather Your Supply By Purchasing And Negotiating Directly With The Customers (Without Making Them Upset). Or Buy Hunting For The Goods Yourself, You Can Go Out Bidding For And Looking Through Storage Units Trying To Find Treasure And Collectables Worth Enough To Keep Yourself In Business.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whether Your Looking Through Storage Units Or Negotiating With Your Customers Many Items Might Just Be To Good To Be True. You Can Take Rare And Collectable Items To The Authenticator If Its Real The Value Of Your Good Can Skyrocket ! But If Its Not Real Well Not So Much... <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As You Make Better And Better Deals And Improve The Look Of Your Store You Can Expand Your Business. Taking On Higher Rents And Bills Gives You More Store Space And A Higher Volume Of Customers Coming In For Buying And Selling.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As You Improve The Business You Might Not Have Time To Be At The Store Making Every Deal Yourself, But Thankfully Low Paid Employees Will Be There To Help ! Weather You Need A Cashier To Work The Deals While Your Gone, A Janitor To Keep Up With The Messy Customers, Or Security To Stop Those Pesky Thieves, You Can Do It All.<br></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a small storefront and work your way to becoming the city’s ultimate entrepreneur. Buy, sell, and trade anything that comes through your door as you build your empire one deal at a time. Manage and upgrade your shop, hire employees to keep business growing. Grow your influence, discover new opportunities, and develop your modest<br> business into a huge monopoly that takes over the entire city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We Have A Small Team That Has Put This Project Together And We Will Continue To Build And Update The Community As We Go! Here's A Brief Rundown Of Our Roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/e332aaef3611ae4f76f6db9db835047a.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 /></span>BannanaDev Is Our Development Lead, Elliot Cecere And SnorMike (aka Michael Cali) Are In Charge Of Music Production, Slicersteel0 Is Our Head Modeler, And I'm Crow I Handle The Creative Development And Marketing For Our Game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/81f29312a8ca5c93924e1c3312501491.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In Pawn City You Can Gather Your Supply By Purchasing And Negotiating Directly With The Customers (Without Making Them Upset). Or Buy Hunting For The Goods Yourself, You Can Go Out Bidding For And Looking Through Storage Units Trying To Find Treasure And Collectables Worth Enough To Keep Yourself In Business.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/4b4047a01a7dd108d4e388c95b501c0d.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whether Your Looking Through Storage Units Or Negotiating With Your Customers Many Items Might Just Be To Good To Be True. You Can Take Rare And Collectable Items To The Authenticator If Its Real The Value Of Your Good Can Skyrocket ! But If Its Not Real Well Not So Much... <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/9cf9e7ba00d5b58de86fbbf712ff7b3f.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As You Make Better And Better Deals And Improve The Look Of Your Store You Can Expand Your Business. Taking On Higher Rents And Bills Gives You More Store Space And A Higher Volume Of Customers Coming In For Buying And Selling.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.poster.avif?t=1780115754\" width=1000 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.webm?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/extras/505d63592fedac9083434ca9d5c63aa0.mp4?t=1780115754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>As You Improve The Business You Might Not Have Time To Be At The Store Making Every Deal Yourself, But Thankfully Low Paid Employees Will Be There To Help ! Weather You Need A Cashier To Work The Deals While Your Gone, A Janitor To Keep Up With The Messy Customers, Or Security To Stop Those Pesky Thieves, You Can Do It All.<br></p>", "short_description": "From A Single Store To A Monopoly - Buy Sell And Trade Anything That Comes Through Your Door. Expand Your Business, Hire Employees, Bid For Storage Units, Don't Get Scammed, And Take Over The City !", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/7a87f652c90b51da4c35f17aed8acabbc2839787/header.jpg?t=1780115754", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/c5dcf919d94eeb44b390d8985fc7dc993812a952/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780115754", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775850/c5dcf919d94eeb44b390d8985fc7dc993812a952/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780115754", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows  10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3GHz 4-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows  10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.5GHz 6-Core or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060 or Radeon RX 6700<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Crow"], "publishers": ["Crow's Creations"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto